      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>Thank you to Elissa Brown, Noah Slovin, Diane Litwin, Rebekah Steinfeld, Annie Bass, and Rachel Katz for sharing this recording. (Aharon Varady held the camera steady.) Lyrics by Elissa Brown, Noah Slovin, and Diane Litwin. Thank you to Teva Learning Alliance for radiating on everyone a light that’s shining like the sun. Thanks to Hazon for sharing their pea costume. The more that we give the more we’ve got to give. It’s the way that we live, and it’s what we’re livin’ for! L’shana tova!</tei:p>
        <tei:p>Recordings</tei:p>
